Check the comparison: `if (!prev || t > prev.t || (t === prev.t && (id > prev.id || (id === prev.id && pos > prev.pos))))`. 

Case t > prev.t → replace. t === prev.t, id > prev.id → replace. t === prev.t, id === prev.id, pos > prev.pos → replace. t === prev.t, id < prev.id → keep prev. t < prev.t → keep prev. Correct lexicographic (t, id, pos) maximization. ✓

